    "value": [
      {
        "id": "R1",
        "text": "Process hits in order; each hit removes the brick at that cell if present."
      },
      {
        "id": "R2",
        "text": "After a hit, every brick no longer connected to the top row falls and is removed from the grid."
      },
      {
        "id": "R3",
        "text": "Report, per hit, the number of bricks that fell, excluding the erased brick; a hit on an empty cell reports 0."
      },
      {
        "id": "R4",
        "text": "Bricks that are already unstable in the initial grid are never counted, and a hit on such a brick drops nothing."
      },
      {
        "id": "R5",
        "text": "Leave the grid and the hit list unchanged; return a fresh list."
      }
    ]
  },
